<title>NIGERIA: Three Nigerian soldiers die in clash with lumbermen.</title>
<headline>Three Nigerian soldiers die in clash with lumbermen.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three soldiers were killed and two others missing in a confrontation between members of an official task force set up to check on illegal logging and lumbermen, a police commissioner said.</p>
<p>Local newspapers quoted police commissioner Hamisu Isah of the mid-western Edo state as saying that the clash occurred on Wednesday in the forest community of Oghare.</p>
<p>He said 14 suspects had been arrested over the incident.</p>
</text>
